# E16 Replicator Dynamics in a sequential, fixed order: a variant of the oracles, the original sources but its line (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/ReplicatorDynamicsSeq/).
# Sequential, so the C# fixes every line: the whole trace in order, the senders of the messages included.
ignore ^$
cover all
fact trace ^(.+)$
same trace seq
